{"id":"6af8cb59-be70-83ec-8c96-80bb124eda94","sections":[{"bodySize":1005,"controls":{"checkbox":5,"fields":2,"radio":8,"reveal":0,"submit":1,"textarea":0},"count":5,"heading":"八、章末綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">本組共 5 題，包含光子能量換算、X 射線管、布拉格繞射與跨概念判斷。難度比前面的例題高一些，主要檢查能否辨認題目所涉及的物理關係。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 4);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><h2 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"lg\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">本章綜合測驗</strong></h2><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">共 5 題，每題 20 分，總分 100 分</p></div><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">進階應用</div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 1 題｜最短波長（填空）</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某 X 射線管的電子由近乎靜止開始，經過 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45\\ \\mathrm{kV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0139em;\">kV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 加速電壓後撞擊金屬靶。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">求產生的 X 射線最短波長，答案以 nm 表示，取至小數第四位。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\"><input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值\" id=\"_r_e9_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">nm</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 2 題｜光子能量（填空）</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某單一 X 射線光子的波長為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.062</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.062\\ \\mathrm{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.062</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">求該光子的能量，答案以 keV 表示。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\"><input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值\" id=\"_r_ee_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">keV</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 3 題｜布拉格繞射角（單選）</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某晶體的晶面間距為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20\\ \\mathrm{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，使用波長 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20\\ \\mathrm{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 X 射線照射，觀察到第一級繞射峰。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">如果繞射儀記錄的是 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，那麼該峰應出現在什麼角度？</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_eh_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_eh_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>30°</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_ej_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_ej_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>60°</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_el_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_el_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>90°</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_en_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_en_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>120°</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 4 題｜觀念整合（多選）</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">下列關於 X 射線的敘述，哪些正確？（可複選，需全部選對才得分）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_eq_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_eq_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. X 射線波長減半時，單一光子能量加倍。</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_er_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_er_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 特性 X 射線的光子能量與靶材原子的能階差有關。</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_es_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_es_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 在加速電壓不變時，將管電流加倍，最短波長也會減半。</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_et_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_et_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 布拉格繞射峰的形成與散射波的相長干涉有關。</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_eu_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_eu_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>E. X 射線因具有負電荷，因此容易受到磁場偏折。</span></label></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 5 題｜能量守恆與 X 射線產生（單選）</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某理想化 X 射線管中，電子由靜止開始，僅受到 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24\\ \\mathrm{kV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0139em;\">kV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 電位差加速，接著撞擊靶材。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">若有人聲稱此 X 射線管產生了能量 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\ \\mathrm{keV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0139em;\">keV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的單一光子，下列判斷何者正確？</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_f0_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_f0_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>合理，因為制動輻射能量可以大於原本電子的動能</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_f2_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_f2_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>合理，只要選擇具有特性 X 射線的靶材即可</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_f4_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_f4_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>不合理，因為電子最多只有 24 keV 的動能可轉換成單一光子</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_f6_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_f6_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>不合理，因為 X 射線的能量與電壓完全無關</label></div></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提交答案並計分</span></button></div>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">完成本章的理解標準：</strong></span> 能區分制動輻射與特性 X 射線的來源，知道電子加速電壓如何限制最大光子能量，能在光子能量與波長間換算，並能從干涉原理理解布拉格定律，以及正確區分 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。這些能力足以應對本章常見的基礎及進階高中物理題型。</p>","messageId":"9af10d4a-c360-4b9a-90ce-e171fb4f1253","numbered":["1","2","3","4","5"],"progress":[]},{"bodySize":22,"controls":{"checkbox":0,"fields":0,"radio":0,"reveal":0,"submit":0,"textarea":0},"count":0,"heading":"本章綜合測驗","messageId":"9af10d4a-c360-4b9a-90ce-e171fb4f1253","numbered":[],"progress":[]}]}